---
// The preview home, from its accepted design. The full template is being built by the Pinies;
// until then this page is the theme's home and the rest of the site is EmDash's own template.
import PinyStudio from "../components/PinyStudio.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Morning Table — a neighbourhood café</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400..600;1,400..600&family=Karla:wght@400..600&display=swap">
</head>
<body class="home overflow-x-clip leading-natural">
<!-- The signature: stillness. One full-bleed picture, slowly changing as the morning goes, small words, one action. -->
<section class="shade-morning relative isolate h-screen min-h-160 overflow-hidden text-tertiary-100 max-md:h-180 max-md:min-h-0">
  <img class="morning-photo absolute inset-0 -z-2 size-full object-cover" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567880905822-56f8e06fe630?w=2400&q=75&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="The café in morning light, a curved counter"><img class="morning-photo absolute inset-0 -z-2 size-full object-cover" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1778085256733-41ffea6f8898?w=2400&q=75&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A long wooden table by the window"><img class="morning-photo absolute inset-0 -z-2 size-full object-cover" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1577968897966-3d4325b36b61?w=2400&q=75&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A cappuccino on a wooden table">
  <header class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 text-shadow-photo"><div class="flex h-21 items-center justify-between px-gutter text-small tracking-nav uppercase"><a class="font-serif text-wordmark tracking-mark normal-case italic" href="/">Morning Table</a><nav class="flex gap-7"><a class="max-md:not-last:hidden" href="/menu">Menu</a><a class="max-md:not-last:hidden" href="/bakery">Bakery</a><a class="max-md:not-last:hidden" href="/visit">Visit</a></nav></div></header>
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-11"><div class="flex items-end justify-between px-gutter max-md:flex-col max-md:items-start max-md:gap-4.5">
    <div><h1 class="appear font-serif text-heading/title font-medium tracking-title text-wrap text-shadow-photo max-md:text-heading-xs">Coffee, bread and a table by the window.<br>Every morning from seven.</h1><div class="mt-2.5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-meta font-semibold tracking-nav uppercase text-shadow-photo"><i class="breathe size-2 rounded-full bg-success"></i>Open now · until 3 pm</div></div>
    <a class="border border-tertiary-100/70 px-6.5 py-3.5 text-small tracking-label uppercase transition-colors duration-400 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-tertiary-100 hover:text-neutral-700" href="/visit#book">Book a table</a>
  </div></div>
</section>
<main>
  <section class="pt-27.5 pb-22.5 max-md:pt-16 max-md:pb-14"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-menu gap-20 max-md:grid-cols-1 max-md:gap-7">
    <div class="fade"><h2 class="font-serif text-heading-lg/snug font-normal tracking-normal text-wrap max-md:text-heading-sm">This morning</h2><p class="mt-4.5 max-w-lede text-body/copy text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-100">A short menu that changes with the bakery. Coffee from one roaster, milk from one farm.</p></div>
    <dl class="border-t border-tertiary-600 dark:border-neutral-600">
      <div class="fade grid grid-cols-row gap-x-4.5 gap-y-1 border-b border-tertiary-600 py-4.5 dark:border-neutral-600"><dt class="font-serif text-item">Flat white</dt><dd class="self-center text-meta text-secondary-600 dark:text-secondary-400">5.0</dd><dd class="col-start-1 text-small text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-100">Our house blend, or the single origin of the week</dd></div>
      <div class="fade grid grid-cols-row gap-x-4.5 gap-y-1 border-b border-tertiary-600 py-4.5 dark:border-neutral-600"><dt class="font-serif text-item">Croissant, from the oven at seven</dt><dd class="self-center text-meta text-secondary-600 dark:text-secondary-400">5.5</dd><dd class="col-start-1 text-small text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-100">Butter, three days of folding</dd></div>
      <div class="fade grid grid-cols-row gap-x-4.5 gap-y-1 border-b border-tertiary-600 py-4.5 dark:border-neutral-600"><dt class="font-serif text-item">Sourdough, ricotta, honey</dt><dd class="self-center text-meta text-secondary-600 dark:text-secondary-400">14</dd><dd class="col-start-1 text-small text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-100">Thick toast, whipped ricotta, local honey</dd></div>
      <div class="fade grid grid-cols-row gap-x-4.5 gap-y-1 border-b border-tertiary-600 py-4.5 dark:border-neutral-600"><dt class="font-serif text-item">Eggs on the table</dt><dd class="self-center text-meta text-secondary-600 dark:text-secondary-400">19</dd><dd class="col-start-1 text-small text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-100">Soft scrambled, greens, rye</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div></section>
  <section class="grid min-h-140 grid-cols-split-flip bg-primary-700 text-tertiary-300 dark:bg-primary-950 max-md:grid-cols-1"><div class="relative overflow-hidden max-md:min-h-75"><img class="zoom-in absolute inset-0 size-full object-cover" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1623334044303-241021148842?w=1600&q=75&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Croissants on the bakery table" loading="lazy"></div><div class="fade flex flex-col justify-center px-14 py-18 max-md:px-gutter max-md:py-10"><h2 class="font-serif text-heading/heading font-normal tracking-normal text-wrap">The bakery opens first</h2><p class="mt-4 text-body/copy opacity-85">The ovens are on at four. What sells out is gone until tomorrow, and the board by the door says what is left.</p><div class="mt-6.5 text-label tracking-label text-secondary-600 uppercase dark:text-secondary-400">Bread from 7 · Pastry until sold out</div></div></section>
  <section class="py-22.5 text-center"><div class="wrap fade"><h2 class="font-serif text-heading-sm/natural font-normal tracking-normal text-wrap">Visit</h2><p class="mt-3 text-body/loose text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-100">The corner by the park · Monday to Sunday, 7 am to 3 pm<br>Walk-ins welcome; tables for six or more, book ahead.</p></div></section>
</main>
<footer class="border-t border-tertiary-600 pt-9 pb-11 dark:border-neutral-600"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-home-footer items-end gap-10 max-md:grid-cols-1">
  <div class="flex items-end gap-4.5 max-md:flex-col max-md:items-start"><div class="pinies flex"><span class="face -mr-2 size-12.5 *:size-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="-62 -62 124 124" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g><path d="M-12,33 L-13,50" stroke="#7D73D9" stroke-width="4.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><ellipse cx="-15" cy="52" rx="6.5" ry="3.8" fill="#26215C" stroke="#7D73D9" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M12,33 L13,50" stroke="#7D73D9" stroke-width="4.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><ellipse cx="15" cy="52" rx="6.5" ry="3.8" fill="#26215C" stroke="#7D73D9" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M-27.309516212355263,17 Q-39.30951621235526,22 -41.30951621235526,31" stroke="#7D73D9" stroke-width="4.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M27.309516212355263,17 Q35.15475810617763,20 33,27" stroke="#7D73D9" stroke-width="4.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/><path data-piny-part="outline" d="M0,-41 A41,41 0 1 1 0,41 A41,41 0 1 1 0,-41 Z" fill="#AFA9EC" stroke="#7D73D9" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><ellipse cx="-20" cy="11" rx="5" ry="3" fill="#F06F8B" opacity=".28"/><ellipse cx="20" cy="11" rx="5" ry="3" fill="#F06F8B" opacity=".28"/></g><g><ellipse cx="-13" cy="-7" rx="7.5" ry="7.50" fill="#fff"/><circle cx="-11.5" cy="-6" r="3.80" fill="#2C2C2A"/><circle cx="-10.2" cy="-7.6" r="1.2" fill="#fff"/><ellipse cx="13" cy="-7" rx="7.5" ry="7.50" fill="#fff"/><circle cx="14.5" cy="-6" r="3.80" fill="#2C2C2A"/><circle cx="15.8" cy="-7.6" r="1.2" fill="#fff"/></g><g><path d="M-8.00,13 Q0,18.00 8.00,13" stroke="#26215C" stroke-width="2.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/></g><g><g class="piny-prop piny-prop-roadmap"><g transform="translate(34,14) rotate(8)"><rect x="0" y="0" width="30" height="23" rx="3" fill="#F7F5EE" stroke="#5F5E5A" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M5,18 C10,18 9,9 15,10 C21,11 22,5 25,5" stroke="#534AB7" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="5" cy="18" r="2" fill="#534AB7"/><circle cx="25" cy=